## Milestone Summary

Five phases, 11 plans, ~61 commits. Completed the brownfield security compliance portal with four new capabilities: Rust agent evidence parity, manual evidence uploads, audit-ready export, and remediation workflow — verified end-to-end with integration tests across all tenant isolation boundaries.

